// CACHE CRITICAL: cache-stable variants for the provider-context rewrite path.
//
// `applyQueuedGoalProviderContextRewrites` in queued-goal-work.ts mutates an
// in-place historical message every turn so the agent always sees the current
// continuation prompt at a fixed message position. That position is *before*
// the rolling tail, so every byte of these prompts must be stable across turns
// for a given (goalId, objective). Volatile fields — elapsed time, tokens
